  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together chili flakes, BBQ sauce, and coconut oil.",
    "Add chicken, wild garlic, and chopped cilantro to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "Thread chicken and vegetables onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush the grill with oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Transfer skewers to a plate and garnish with wild onions and cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately."
